# TEMPORARY — homecrew/ is being served from this deploy so the owner has a
# review link. It is a separate business on a separate domain (homecrewfl.com)
# and does not belong on firstrehabnpb.com long term.
#
# While it is here it is protected two ways:
#   - vercel.json sends `X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive` for
#     /homecrew/(.*), so it can never be indexed under the clinic's domain
#   - the portal reads real client data only with real keys; the shareable link
#     uses ?demo=1, which forces invented sample data
#
# Move it to its own repo and Vercel project before launch, then restore the
# `homecrew/` line below.
#
